      "description": "Adjunct- Biology Department - Virginia Military Institute We use cookies to improve your experience. Please read our Website/Internet Privacy Policy or click Accept . Skip to content Calendar Offices A-Z Give Search Apply Visit Inquire Admissions & Aid Admissions & Aid » Embrace the VMI experience – where tradition builds transformation and lifelong impact. Prospective Cadets » Get started on the road to VMI and your future. Visit VMI » Explore post (campus), meet cadets, and see what sets VMI apart. Appointed Students » Complete required forms and prepare to arrive in August. Affording VMI » Learn how generous financial aid puts a VMI education within reach. Apply Now » Ready to take on the challenge? Applications open Aug. 1 each year. Information for Parents » Tools and resources on how parents can assist with financial aid and support their cadets. Next Steps Upcoming Admissions Events Prepare for Success Meet the Admissions Team Enrollment Services Scholarships, Grants, and Loans Veterans Benefits Applying for Aid Admissions & Aid Admissions & Aid Visit VMI Apply Now Appointed Students Affording VMI Prospective Cadets Meet the Admissions Team Prepare for Success Scholarships, Grants, and Loans Veterans Benefits Applying for Aid Academics Academics » Each program at the Institute, from engineering and the humanities, to science and business, is designed to challenge cadets academically. Academic Program » VMI’s core curriculum builds the foundation for success during and after undergraduate school. Majors & Minors » Rigorous courses are available in STEM and the humanities, all with small class sizes. Research & Enrichment » Providing scholars with opportunities to take their learning beyond the classroom. Excellence & Achievement » Nurturing top academic talent through an honors program and prestigious scholarships. Academics & Opportunities Academic Departments Summer Programs Global Education Student Support & Resources Support Services 